WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.888 --> 00:00:21.441
"'We eat Mayor Hubbletree was reading the cheerleaders' banner out loud.

2
00:00:23.182 --> 00:00:27.085
Suddenly his face clouded, and he spun around to face Mr.

3
00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:28.906
Freaky. "People?

4
00:00:29.626 --> 00:00:31.728
You eat people?"

5
00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:34.901
"Eek!" cried a human girl.

6
00:00:34.921 --> 00:00:37.303
"The monsters are going to eat us!"

7
00:00:38.003 --> 00:00:39.024
"Run for your lives!"

8
00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:40.625
cried a human boy.

9
00:00:41.266 --> 00:00:44.809
The human kids started pushing and shoving to get back to their bus.

10
00:00:45.469 --> 00:00:48.131
Then—whoosh! The banner burst into flames.

11
00:00:48.752 --> 00:00:50.754
People and monsters screamed.

12
00:00:55.177 --> 00:00:56.358
settle down!"

13
00:00:56.818 --> 00:00:57.359
cried Mr.

14
00:00:57.419 --> 00:01:01.042
Freaky. He pulled out a handkerchief and blew his noses.

15
00:01:05.445 --> 00:01:07.746
"Everything is totally under control!"

16
00:01:08.766 --> 00:01:10.327
Mayor Hubbletree glared at him.

17
00:01:10.347 --> 00:01:13.768
"Is this your idea of a joke, Freaky?"

18
00:01:14.728 --> 00:01:16.429
The head cheerleader rushed over.

19
00:01:16.449 --> 00:01:18.750
"We're so sorry, Mr.

20
00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:23.232
Freaky. The banner wasn't supposed to say, 'We Eat People!'

21
00:01:24.052 --> 00:01:27.114
It was supposed to say, 'Welcome, People!'"

22
00:01:28.414 --> 00:01:29.895
Loud laughter rang out.

23
00:01:32.812 --> 00:01:35.654
Ben turned and saw it was coming from the Doppel Gang.

24
00:01:36.575 --> 00:01:40.498
All three of the doppelgangers were bent over, laughing hysterically.

25
00:01:44.602 --> 00:01:46.463
Mr. Freaky stalked over to them.

26
00:01:46.483 --> 00:01:50.446
"It was you three, wasn't it?

27
00:01:51.187 --> 00:01:54.950
You changed the message on the banner and then made it burst into flames!"

28
00:01:55.931 --> 00:01:57.752
The Doppel Gang stopped laughing.

29
00:01:57.772 --> 00:01:59.093
"No way!"

30
00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:00.174
cried Moe.

31
00:02:00.194 --> 00:02:01.896
"We didn't cause the fire!"

32
00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.181
"Yeah, that wasn't us!"

33
00:02:04.761 --> 00:02:05.521
added Carly.

34
00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:09.202
"I don't believe you," said Mr.

35
00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:10.983
Freaky. "Mr.

36
00:02:11.043 --> 00:02:14.004
Gwarg, please escort the Doppel Gang to my office.

37
00:02:15.124 --> 00:02:17.745
Ask the office ogre to call their parents."

38
00:02:19.485 --> 00:02:22.906
Mr. Gwarg led the doppelgangers back into the school building.

39
00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:26.647
Mr. Freaky looked at the mayor and Ms.

40
00:02:26.707 --> 00:02:28.608
Prim, and grinned sheepishly.

41
00:02:29.632 --> 00:02:30.993
"Sorry about that.

42
00:02:31.453 --> 00:02:36.135
Unfortunately, we have some students here at Monster Academy who like to play pranks.

43
00:02:37.456 --> 00:02:41.557
I can assure you, Mayor Hubbletree, nobody is going to get eaten."

44
00:02:43.078 --> 00:02:45.439
Mayor Hubbletree made some grumbling noises.

45
00:02:49.181 --> 00:02:50.341
Ms. Prim spoke up.

46
00:02:50.361 --> 00:02:51.302
"Well then!"

47
00:02:51.982 --> 00:02:52.762
she said brightly.

48
00:02:52.782 --> 00:02:56.244
"Let's not let a couple of bad apples spoil our day.

49
00:02:57.124 --> 00:02:59.606
I think this field trip is going to be lovely."

50
00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:03.269
Mr. Freaky suddenly clapped his hands in delight.

51
00:03:03.289 --> 00:03:05.831
"Oh, I love bad apples!

52
00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.814
Especially when they get brown and mushy.

53
00:03:09.695 --> 00:03:11.997
And I love to see a small wormhole.

54
00:03:13.278 --> 00:03:15.980
That's how I know there's a tasty treat inside!"

55
00:03:17.341 --> 00:03:18.922
Ms. Prim wrinkled her nose.

56
00:03:18.942 --> 00:03:21.444
"What's next, Freaky?"

57
00:03:21.965 --> 00:03:23.186
asked Mayor Hubbletree.

58
00:03:23.206 --> 00:03:25.468
"Let's get this field trip started."

59
00:03:26.412 --> 00:03:29.834
Just then Ben noticed something out of the corner of his eye.

60
00:03:30.654 --> 00:03:32.635
A human girl darted into the school.

61
00:03:33.375 --> 00:03:36.276
She was wearing a hoodie with a green skull on the back.

62
00:03:37.157 --> 00:03:38.517
A witch had spotted her too.

63
00:03:39.538 --> 00:03:40.958
She went over to tap Mr.

64
00:03:41.018 --> 00:03:41.858
Freaky on the arm.

65
00:03:41.878 --> 00:03:43.699
"Excuse me?

66
00:03:44.139 --> 00:03:44.880
Mr. Freaky?

67
00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:48.401
I think a human girl just ran into the school."

68
00:03:48.421 --> 00:03:50.042
"Are you sure?"

69
00:03:50.622 --> 00:03:51.162
asked Mr.

70
00:03:51.202 --> 00:03:53.243
Freaky. "Ms.

71
00:03:53.303 --> 00:03:55.284
Prim!" Mayor Hubbletree ordered.

72
00:03:55.944 --> 00:03:56.985
"Find out who it was!

73
00:03:57.385 --> 00:03:59.246
This is a dangerous situation."

74
00:04:01.347 --> 00:04:03.928
Ms. Prim started calling out students' names.

75
00:04:03.948 --> 00:04:07.630
"Don't worry, Mayor," said Mr.

76
00:04:07.690 --> 00:04:10.772
Freaky. "Monster Academy is perfectly safe."

77
00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:13.994
"Hmph!" said Mayor Hubbletree.

78
00:04:14.994 --> 00:04:18.957
Ms. Prim came back, looking at her clipboard and muttering to herself.

79
00:04:19.377 --> 00:04:22.258
"Well?" said the mayor.

80
00:04:22.278 --> 00:04:23.559
"Who's missing?

81
00:04:23.979 --> 00:04:25.160
Who ran into the school?"

82
00:04:26.236 --> 00:04:27.456
Ms. Prim looked at him.

83
00:04:27.476 --> 00:04:29.477
"Not one of our students.

84
00:04:29.877 --> 00:04:30.877
They're all right here."

85
00:04:30.897 --> 00:04:37.519
"That witch must be imagining things, Freaky," said Mayor Hubbletree.

86
00:04:37.539 --> 00:04:40.300
"Now, what are we doing first?"

87
00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:47.642
"Our eighth-grade president, Waldo Wizz, has a magnificent science experiment planned," said Mr.

88
00:04:47.702 --> 00:04:51.603
Freaky. "Everybody, follow me to the science lab!"

89
00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:56.765
As everyone headed into the school, Ben wondered again about the mystery girl.

90
00:04:57.526 --> 00:05:00.847
He didn't want to get anyone in trouble, but he'd seen her too.

91
00:05:01.848 --> 00:05:04.770
Who was she, and why did she run into the school?

92
00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:08.612
The human kids were whispering to each other.

93
00:05:08.632 --> 00:05:11.893
"I hope the monsters don't turn us into frogs or something."

94
00:05:14.855 --> 00:05:16.696
"Hey!" said a frog monster.

95
00:05:16.716 --> 00:05:18.937
"What's wrong with frogs?"

96
00:05:21.338 --> 00:05:24.040
"Oh!" The boy laughed nervously.

97
00:05:24.576 --> 00:05:25.416
"Um, nothing."

98
00:05:26.517 --> 00:05:27.997
The frog monster laughed.

99
00:05:28.017 --> 00:05:29.938
"I'm just kidding!"

100
00:05:29.958 --> 00:05:35.439
"Actually, we do need to be careful here," said Dave.

101
00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:37.600
He was walking next to Jen.

102
00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.421
"Last time I was in the science lab, I turned purple."

103
00:05:41.441 --> 00:05:43.862
"And whose fault was that?"

104
00:05:44.482 --> 00:05:46.043
asked Jen, giggling.

105
00:05:47.063 --> 00:05:47.943
Dave grinned.

106
00:05:47.963 --> 00:05:58.198
"Mine!" When the group got upstairs, Mr.

107
00:05:58.258 --> 00:06:02.261
Creepy, the science teacher, hurried ahead to open the lab.

108
00:06:03.402 --> 00:06:06.024
Ben saw him jiggle the door handle a few times.

109
00:06:07.926 --> 00:06:09.667
"That's strange," said Mr.

110
00:06:09.727 --> 00:06:11.929
Creepy. "The door is locked."

111
00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.251
He reached into his pocket.

112
00:06:14.271 --> 00:06:16.993
"Oops. I don't have my key with me."

113
00:06:18.034 --> 00:06:19.075
He knocked on the door.

114
00:06:19.095 --> 00:06:21.357
"Waldo, are you in there?

115
00:06:21.737 --> 00:06:22.077
Open up!"

116
00:06:23.579 --> 00:06:24.820
There was no answer.

117
00:06:26.108 --> 00:06:28.449
"I hope nothing's wrong," Gaby murmured.

118
00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.110
Ben made his way to the door.

119
00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:33.551
"Don't worry, everyone.

120
00:06:34.392 --> 00:06:36.793
I'll float through the door and unlock it from inside."

121
00:06:39.434 --> 00:06:42.755
Concentrating, Ben slowly pushed his head through the door.

122
00:06:43.595 --> 00:06:47.637
He was about to pull the rest of his body through when something made him freeze.

123
00:06:48.418 --> 00:06:51.119
Broken glass and burned hoses covered the floor.

124
00:06:51.919 --> 00:06:53.920
Green liquid formed a large puddle.

125
00:06:54.725 --> 00:06:57.950
And lying unconscious in the middle of it was Waldo!
